# The Rust pack's glue and what no unit builds with: glue.sh, the workers'
# sources it bundles, the pack's tests and their fixtures, and its
# documents. An edit to any of these rebuilds no toolchain. (src/targets.json
# and src/miri-targets.json are the sysroots unit's inputs too.)
glue.paths
glue.sh
build.sh
package.json
package-lock.json
README.md
LICENSES.txt
src/
test*.mjs
test.sh
tests/
